00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:20.840
Because it'll be a bit like Ryanair, you can take your pajamas and your toothbrush,

169
00:13:20.840 --> 00:13:25.080
because you're only allowed to bring love.

170
00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:30.340
That's the permitted baggage.

171
00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:31.340
Okay.

172
00:13:31.340 --> 00:13:36.960
So, Jesus, Louisa continues in their usual state, and Jesus says, "My daughter, when

